// The boss dying: 40 ticks, not looping; it holds the last pose until it
// comes back (docs/architecture.md section 11, "模型和动画"). Rotations are
// YXZ degrees about each bone's position along the model's axes; see
// assets/anims/README.md.
//
// The game lays the node on its face or its back on the tick it dies, and
// lifts the body by enemy_dead_lift (0.30 m in boss.ron), so from the first
// key on the limbs only move in the body's plane (about the model's Z
// axis), and the halberd lies flat in it, beside the right leg, pointing at
// the feet. 6: the arms loosening. 16: limp, the feet stretched out. 30,
// 40: lying, the arms and legs a little apart, the head tipped to one side.
(
    length: 40,
    looping: false,
    bones: {
        "head": (rotation: [
            (0, (0.0, 0.0, 0.0)),
            (6, (0.0, 0.0, 0.0)),
            (16, (0.0, 0.0, 10.0)),
            (30, (0.0, 0.0, 16.0)),
            (40, (0.0, 0.0, 16.0)),
        ]),
        "upper_arm_l": (rotation: [
